Fill in `.env`:
- `TWILIO_SID`, `TWILIO_TOKEN`, `TWILIO_FROM` — from twilio.com
- `RESEND_KEY`, `RESEND_FROM` — from resend.com (verify your domain first)

Restart the server. It will print `LIVE mode`.

